# Mavuika Chevreuse Fischl Yae. ~18s Rot. Mavuika Double Electro Overload. 200s Fighting Spirit burst only in the first rotation. Mav Q 14CD with book. Healer Chevreuse. Evenstar 3EM Yae is very similar to Widsith GT Yae.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
mavuika char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
mavuika add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#mavuika add weapon="tidalshadow" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
